# Allowlist: the build needs entrypoint.sh and nothing else. Without this,
# the context is the whole deployment directory, which on a live server
# means config/ (the SSH host private key and the sync user's home),
# shared/ (every synced file) and keys/. Docker does not read .gitignore.
# Add a matching "!" line here when a new COPY is added to the Dockerfile.
*
!entrypoint.sh
